  "description": "Sun-Woo, the breadwinner of a poor family, is the breadwinner. Despite his drive to excel at anything, his body constantly makes mistakes. Then one day, while working part-time at a moving company, Sun-Woo accidentally breaks a jewelry box belonging to Hui-Jin, the owner of a sex toy company. Unable to repay the debt, he declares he'll do anything, no matter what. Hui-Jin, in response to Sun-Woo's words, suggests he review sex toys, and as the situation escalates, Sun-Woo begins to understand his own desires.\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes 13 extra chapters.*",
